<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:lrc="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" lrc:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">Queen</ttm:name></ttm:agent><sourceMetadata xmlns="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>Freddie Mercury</songwriter></songwriters></sourceMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:27.840"><div begin="23.144" end="47.105" lrc:songPart="Verse"><p begin="23.144" end="24.275" lrc:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1">Mama</p><p begin="25.840" end="27.774" lrc:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1">Just killed a man</p><p begin="28.907" end="31.376" lrc:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1">Put a gun against his head</p><p begin="31.643" end="34.808" lrc:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1">Pulled my trigger, now he's dead</p><p begin="35.376" end="36.560" lrc:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1">Mama</p><p begin="37.643" end="39.737" lrc:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1">Life had just begun</p><p begin="41.402" end="47.105" lrc:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1">But now I've gone and thrown it all away</p></div><div begin="47.770" end="1:08.323" lrc:songPart="Verse"><p begin="47.770" end="51.787" lrc:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1">Mama, ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</p><p begin="53.805" end="56.622" lrc:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1">Didn't mean to make you cry</p><p begin="57.022" end="1:00.990" lrc:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1">If I'm not back again this time tomorrow</p><p begin="1:01.389" end="1:04.590" lrc:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1">Carry on, carry on</p><p begin="1:04.606" end="1:08.323" lrc:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1">As if nothing really matters</p></div><div begin="1:17.374" end="1:39.878" lrc:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:17.374" end="1:18.542" lrc:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1">Too late</p><p begin="1:19.993" end="1:21.742" lrc:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1">My time has come</p><p begin="1:23.027" end="1:25.475" lrc:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1">Sends shivers down my spine</p><p begin="1:25.811" end="1:28.929" lrc:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1">Body's aching all the time</p><p begin="1:29.610" end="1:31.777" lrc:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1">Goodbye, everybody</p><p begin="1:32.495" end="1:35.294" lrc:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1">I've got to go</p><p begin="1:35.646" end="1:39.878" lrc:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta leave you all behind and face the truth</p></div><div begin="1:41.913" end="1:57.142" lrc:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:41.913" end="1:45.774" lrc:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1">Mama, ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</p><p begin="1:47.940" end="1:50.740" lrc:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna die</p><p begin="1:50.940" end="1:57.142" lrc:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1">I sometimes wish I'd never been born at all</p></div></body></tt>